    <h1>Residency and Long-Term Status</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">Considering a future in the Philippines? Understand your options before you commit.</p>

    <p>If you are considering a longer-term or permanent move to the Philippines, a range of residency and long-term status options may be available depending on your circumstances. Foreign Immigration Services helps you understand which options may apply to you and manages the application process.</p>

    <div class="media-split media-split--reverse">
